extpay.js is the ExtensionPay SDK (ExtPay.js) by Glench, vendored unmodified.

Source:  https://github.com/Glench/ExtPay  (npm: extpay, dist/ExtPay.js)
License: ISC

Used for monetization: the $4.99 one-time unlock + paid-status checks. Loaded
three ways from the one file:
  - service worker:  importScripts('/lib/extpay.js')  → ExtPay('vidload').startBackground()
  - extensionpay.com content script (relays paid status back to the extension)
  - (popup talks to the SW, which owns the ExtPay instance)

extpayId is 'vidload' — must match the Extension ID registered at
extensionpay.com. NOT fetched at runtime → no remote code.

To update: download a fresh dist/ExtPay.js from the repo and overwrite this
file, keeping the path/filename so the manifest references still resolve.
